# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own key. Never commit .env.
#
# kie.ai API key. Only needed if you want scroll-craft to GENERATE imagery and
# video. If you are building from your own photos and footage, you can skip it
# entirely: the skill supports a fully bring-your-own-assets build, and one of
# the reference builds ships with zero generated imagery.
#
# Get a key at: https://kie.ai
#
# Cost, so it is not a surprise. Published rates are 28 credits per still and
# 160 credits per 5-second clip. A modest six-act page is around 520 credits. A
# ten-leg continuous-world flight is closer to 2,000 credits at those rates,
# though observed billing has run well under the published numbers.
KIE_AI_API_KEY=your-key-here
